        'Mediterranean Sea crossings: over 25,000 migrants have died attempting the crossing since 2014. In 2015 alone, over 1 million arrived in Europe by sea. This triggered the EU migration crisis, challenging the Schengen open-borders system.',
        'The EU Free Movement principle allows 450 million citizens to live and work in any member state. After Brexit, UK nationals lost this right. The A8 accession (2004) saw significant East-West migration within the EU.',
